        {
          "id": "792392c9-be2e-4f66-b47e-ed7311ab8283",
          "name": "Check System Status",
          "request": {
            "name": "Check System Status",
            "description": {
              "content": "Check the system business status. Returns the current operational status for each\nsupported business type (SPOT, CONVERT). If no `businessType` parameter is provided,\nthe response includes the status for all business types. Use this endpoint to verify\nservice availability before placing orders or executing conversions.\n\n**businessStatus Values**\n\n- `on` — Business type is enabled and fully operational.\n- `off` — Business type is disabled or under maintenance.\n\n---\n\n## Additional Info\n\n**Rate Limit** [📖 Learn More](https://api.docs.coins.ph/reference/general#api-limit-introduction)\n\nWeight: 2 (UID)\n\n**Use Cases** [🧩 SDK](https://api.docs.coins.ph/reference/general#sdk)\n\n- **Pre-Trade Verification** — Check SPOT status before placing orders to avoid unnecessary failures.\n- **Maintenance Detection** — Detect planned or unplanned maintenance windows programmatically.\n- **Multi-Business Monitoring** — Monitor status of both SPOT and CONVERT in one call.\n\n**Best Practices**\n\n- Check this endpoint before initiating critical trading or conversion workflows.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "openapi",
                "v1",
                "check-sys-status"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "businessType",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Business type to query. Optional values: SPOT, CONVERT. If not provided, returns status for all business types.\n"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "recvWindow",
                  "value": "<long>",
                  "description": "Request validity window in milliseconds. Default: 5000, Maximum: 60000."
                },
